preConditionHook:
// The bar opens beyond the prior bar's close in the trend direction: a
// body-to-body gap, Brooks's sign of urgency. No thresholds anywhere in the
// four sources, so no inputs.
//
// Distinct from TrueGapBar, which needs the whole RANGE clear (low[0] above
// high[1]); this only needs the bodies not to overlap at the join, so it fires
// on far more bars. Distinct from ConsecutiveBodyGapTrendBars, which ANDs this
// with a trend-bar body over a run of N bars.
//
// Both operands are raw tick-grid prices, so the 2.22e-12 relational tolerance
// is inert here; el_gt/el_lt are used anyway because EL evaluates a relational
// operator and every one of them carries it.
